    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d525">

                <pb facs="0624" n="614" sameAs="frus:frus1948v08/pg614"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.50 Recovery/6–2948: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Stuart</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Nanking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1948-06-29T18:00:00+09:00">June 29, 1948—6
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 11:18 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1180. Reference your second paragraph, change being made draft including quoted
                    language since RRC<anchor n="2" xml:id="d525-f1"/> agreement negotiation has
                    been suspended in order accelerate bilateral ([refDep]tel 939, June 28<anchor
                        n="3" xml:id="d525-f2"/>).</p>
                <pb facs="0625" n="615" xml:id="pg615"/>
                <p>Reference your third paragraph, Legislative Yuan passed resolution terms
                    foreshadowed Embtel 1128, June 23.<anchor n="4" xml:id="d525-f3"/></p>
                <p>Embassy requesting Foreign Minister<anchor n="5" xml:id="d525-f4"/> authorization
                    to sign.</p>
                <p>Embassy will inform prior signature any deviation amended text now in
                    Department’s hands.</p>
                <p>Sent Department, repeated Shanghai 548.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stuart</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
